        <mxCell id="JNQT5e8aB8y3lf0q37bL-1" value="Inverter MCU 설정핀 확인&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;GPIO4 &lt;/b&gt;/ PC14-OSC32-IN : GPIO output, debug용 출력(함수 시작 끝 debug)&amp;nbsp; -&amp;gt; O&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;COM_Slot : COM_slot일 때 set&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;GPIO7 &lt;/b&gt;input&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Pull up: hardwareGPIO debug -&amp;gt; O&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;GPIO6 &lt;/b&gt;input&amp;nbsp; Pull up: hardwareGPIO debug -&amp;gt; O&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(86, 156, 214);&quot;&gt;GPIO6_GPIO_Port&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(156, 220, 254);&quot;&gt;BSRR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; wh